// Redact removes every credential held by f from s: a raw proxy value becomes
// its display form (or [redacted] when it is unusable), and its userinfo and
// its password disappear, as written in the value, as Go escapes them and
// decoded. For an unusable value holding "@", everything before the last "@"
// is taken for a userinfo. A secret shorter than 4 bytes is only removed in the
// full value and in user:password@, since replacing it anywhere would damage
// the text; a bare user name shorter than 4 bytes is not removed at all.
func (f Forward) Redact(s string) string {
